    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcStory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a self-proclaimed &quot;stay-at-home security officer&quot; living alone in a small apartment.<br>You have no steady job\u2014your days consist of browsing the internet, playing solitaire, and confronting the pigeons that visit your balcony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day, a letter from your mother brings your peaceful routine to an end:<br><strong>&quot;Starting next month, I\u2019ll stop sending you money. It\u2019s time for you to support yourself.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only a short grace period left, you must face reality.<br>Will you take your first steps into the world... or cling to your current lifestyle?<br>Your daily choices shape the branching storyline that follows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcGame Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses in <strong>in-game days</strong>, not real time.<br>Each day, you\u2019ll click around your room to choose how you spend your time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to the doorbell and talk to visitors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase away pigeons on the balcony</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape reality by gaming on your PC</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on daily chores like taking out the trash</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing your actions for the day, time advances to the next day.<br>Depending on your decisions, the story branches and evolves.<br>This is a <strong>2D, multi-ending slice-of-life simulation</strong> with a twist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcControls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse-only gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click to examine objects and characters in your room</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcStory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a self-proclaimed &quot;stay-at-home security officer&quot; living alone in a small apartment.<br>You have no steady job\u2014your days consist of browsing the internet, playing solitaire, and confronting the pigeons that visit your balcony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day, a letter from your mother brings your peaceful routine to an end:<br><strong>&quot;Starting next month, I\u2019ll stop sending you money. It\u2019s time for you to support yourself.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only a short grace period left, you must face reality.<br>Will you take your first steps into the world... or cling to your current lifestyle?<br>Your daily choices shape the branching storyline that follows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcGame Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses in <strong>in-game days</strong>, not real time.<br>Each day, you\u2019ll click around your room to choose how you spend your time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to the doorbell and talk to visitors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase away pigeons on the balcony</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape reality by gaming on your PC</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on daily chores like taking out the trash</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing your actions for the day, time advances to the next day.<br>Depending on your decisions, the story branches and evolves.<br>This is a <strong>2D, multi-ending slice-of-life simulation</strong> with a twist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcControls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse-only gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left-click to examine objects and characters in your room</p></li></ul></li></ul>",
